---
import CompanionDoor from '../../framing/CompanionDoor.astro';

/**
 * `/child/set/`: the suggestion set on the younger-child path.
 *
 * Not `/child/`, which is the **standing guide** — the screen this path meets
 * before the catalog, and its own ticket
 * ([#30](https://github.com/inarush0/spiritual-collective/issues/30)). A
 * companion caring for a younger child reads how to offer and how to adapt
 * before they are handed anything to offer.
 *
 * The set is the companion set, unchanged, with the **no-suitability
 * statement** over it: the same practices everyone else sees, with notes on
 * adapting them, and no claim about which one suits a particular child. The
 * screen is `src/framing/CompanionDoor.astro`, shared with `/with/`.
 */
---

<CompanionDoor path="child" />
